  <h6>Other benefits in the manual — HR reference</h6>
  <p class="small">My Leave shows verified opening balances and separate entitlements per event. HR reviews event eligibility and evidence. Carry-forward expiry, insurance enrolment and awards remain HR-managed.</p>
  <ul class="small mb-0">
   <li>Annual leave: confirmed employees, 12 days for the first completed service year, then one additional day per completed year up to 26. New employees are prorated by completed months. Up to 14 unused days expire on 31 December of the following year; the excess expires on 30 April.</li>
   <li>Sick leave: 14 days below two years of service, 18 days from two to below five years, 22 days thereafter. Hospitalisation: 60 calendar days.</li>
   <li>Marriage: seven consecutive days for first legal marriage, confirmed with one year of service. Compassionate leave: four consecutive days for confirmed employees for the listed family relationships (spouse, natural parents/siblings/grandparents or parents-in-law).</li>
   <li>Maternity: 98 calendar days, with the manual's service and documentation conditions. Paternity: seven consecutive days, confirmed with one year of service, starting within the first week after birth; the manual specifies the first five children. HR reviews full eligibility and evidence.</li>
   <li>Group personal accident insurance: confirmed employees; coverage follows the employee's insurance card and master policy. The listed death/disability and medical pairs are RM50,000/RM3,500, RM100,000/RM4,500 and RM150,000/RM5,500. The manual does not map plans to grades.</li>
   <li>Zero-MC award: RM300 for a confirmed employee with no medical leave throughout a whole calendar year, subject to HR verification.</li>
